        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMGR32, Maguire Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom the Yale Expressions Residential collection, the Single Cylinder Maguire Deadbolt is a simple door lock made with easy installation in mind. It will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from traditional finish colors for the Maguire Deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Yale Expressions Maguire Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Maguire Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMGR32-specifications.pdf?v=1704262434\"><b>Yale YMGR32 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
