                "description": "From the Yale Expressions Residential collection, the Single Cylinder Maguire Deadbolt is a simple door lock made with easy installation in mind. It will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from traditional finish colors for the Maguire Deadbolt.",
